It’s been a while but here we are with a ton of new stuff - new and totally free content, new languages and fixes. Let’s get to it! 

The biggest addition this time is more game. “Roboto Factory” is a free DLC that lets you get inside the famous Roboto Factory, where all the bots you've met on Speculo were created. You will discover its workings and see your old mechanical companions in a new light.

We’ve also added the support for both simplified and traditional Chinese - now not only you can enjoy the game with Chinese subtitles but also with Chinese text within the game world! 

Additionally we’ve implemented some new fixes: 
We’ve moved onto a newer version of the Unreal Engine. Thanks to that we’ve been able to further optimize the game and improve its performance in some locations;
With the new renderer the depth of field has been improved;
Buggy handles better and has improved physics;
Fixed the achievement “Get 6600 units of graphene” - now it should unlock properly;
Fixed the occasional issue with incorrect display of subtitles;
Added the option to turn off the vibration on gamepads;
The puzzle with guiding a robot at the beginning of the base game has been improved to deliver maximum satisfaction;
Added the option to reset your save files, so you can restart the level you’re currently in. In the main menu just press LCTRL+LSHIFT+F5 and listen for a sound indicating that the reset is done.


Enjoy!

